		expression "Glace de mer" i mean anyways (so that i could find if
		there is a specific	word for it, but considering how close it is
		to the original civ4 French name i mean anyways, maybe it is safe
		(enough) (should be i think i mean anyways hopefully). At least
		it has a clearer name now i mean maybe.
		i mean anyways.) -->
